There are still some (minor) bugs concerning telepathy.

1. If I watch monsters in already discovered DARK rooms   ...k
   the monsters leave a track of points behind them:  .....
   The points disappear only when I enter the dark room again.

2. I wore a helm of telepathy and went through an already
   discovered room. There was a monster behind the wall.
   I see! A secret door must be there! But there were more
   intersting things to do than open the door and kill the monster.
   So I went on. When I was far enough away, the monster 
   disappeared. But on that place a scroll appeared!

3. I discovered a "pseudo-telepathy" bug:

   If there is such a room:    ##########
                             ##########@#
                             ---------|##
                             .........|###
                             .........|#    

   I dig a hole in the corner: ##########   
                             ############   
                             ---------@##   
                             ....k....|###  
   I can see some monsters:  ..o...F..|#    

   I number some places to explain the bug:
            ##########                ##########
          ####@11111##              ####@2222###
          ---------.##              ---------.##
          .........|###             ...o..k...|###
          .........|#               ......F..|#

   If I go the way No. 1, the monsters disappear. OK.
   But if I go diagonally to place No. 2, I can "see" the
   monsters furthermore as if I had telepathy! Funny, isn't it?

